(1901729, 261131, 31403, '<td valign="top">hang a white sheet behind him, bounce a light around that paper onto his face, get him to look at camera (easier said than done, I know) and you''ve got yourself a 7-8 in my opinion - but this just looks like a snapshot with that background 4</td>', 'hang a white sheet behind him, bounce a light around that paper onto his face, get him to look at camera (easier said than done, I know) and you''ve got yourself a 7-8 in my opinion - but this just looks like a snapshot with that background 4', '2005-11-28 07:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901733, 262334, 31403, '<td valign="top">If this were a visual scavenger hunt you might win the ribbon - however this is a photography contest.  The blanket "on board" flash with a black background, and the terribly unfortunate expression you''ve captured, and somone else''s arm?? in the lower right make this look like a bad snapshot.  She may be a very mature 11 year old, take some time to think about how to communicate this visually and set up a "shoot''.  Keep trying - 1</td>', 'If this were a visual scavenger hunt you might win the ribbon - however this is a photography contest.  The blanket "on board" flash with a black background, and the terribly unfortunate expression you''ve captured, and somone else''s arm?? in the lower right make this look like a bad snapshot.  She may be a very mature 11 year old, take some time to think about how to communicate this visually and set up a "shoot''.  Keep trying - 1', '2005-11-28 07:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901743, 262100, 37529, '<td valign="top">Good one.  Made me chuckle.  Fits the chalenge perfectly I think.  The B&amp;W works too.</td>', 'Good one.  Made me chuckle.  Fits the chalenge perfectly I think.  The B&W works too.', '2005-11-28 07:53:46.000000', NULL, 1);
