(1901760, 261616, 33392, '<td valign="top">Just a suggestion, but you might want to consider withdrawing this entry - your account number is quite visible on the top of the page, and is now available to almost anyone on the internet.</td>', 'Just a suggestion, but you might want to consider withdrawing this entry - your account number is quite visible on the top of the page, and is now available to almost anyone on the internet.', '2005-11-28 08:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901762, 262613, 24013, '<td valign="top">noo!  that''s too dreary!!  great light!  it''s got a fairy tale effect.  works well.</td>', 'noo!  that''s too dreary!!  great light!  it''s got a fairy tale effect.  works well.', '2005-11-28 08:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901765, 262571, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is not the typical fare for this challenge and I like it alot.  The vivid colors and contrasting tones (bright blue and yellow) really make this shot for me. It has a kind of gutsy urban sense without being too dark or grungy.  Nicely done. 10</td>', 'This is not the typical fare for this challenge and I like it alot.  The vivid colors and contrasting tones (bright blue and yellow) really make this shot for me. It has a kind of gutsy urban sense without being too dark or grungy.  Nicely done. 10', '2005-11-28 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901766, 262789, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  It almost looks like a still from an old movie, except for the more modern cars. I like the single light of the lamp post and the golden hue of the shot. 8</td>', 'I like this alot.  It almost looks like a still from an old movie, except for the more modern cars. I like the single light of the lamp post and the golden hue of the shot. 8', '2005-11-28 08:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901769, 262488, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love this. the complementary gold/blue tones really help give it some pop along with the perfect focus.  I like the perspective too. Beautiful floors by the way!! 8</td>', 'I just love this. the complementary gold/blue tones really help give it some pop along with the perfect focus.  I like the perspective too. Beautiful floors by the way!! 8', '2005-11-28 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901771, 262169, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot.  The focus is sharp as well. My main complaint is that you didnt'' utilize the maximum 640 pixels, so the image is a bit small.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot.  The focus is sharp as well. My main complaint is that you didnt'' utilize the maximum 640 pixels, so the image is a bit small.', '2005-11-28 08:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901772, 262542, 15711, '<td valign="top">There are quite a few shots like this but with your post editing, you made it interesting. I like the softened label on the tequila bottle and the slightly out of focus of the past due bill. 7</td>', 'There are quite a few shots like this but with your post editing, you made it interesting. I like the softened label on the tequila bottle and the slightly out of focus of the past due bill. 7', '2005-11-28 08:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901774, 261383, 15711, '<td valign="top">What makde this shot for me were the missing eyes on the bear. It''s like a metaphor for adulthood. Perfect lighting. The texture of the concrete walls and floor is almost mimicked by the bear''s fur, using black and white.  Smart~~8</td>', 'What makde this shot for me were the missing eyes on the bear. It''s like a metaphor for adulthood. Perfect lighting. The texture of the concrete walls and floor is almost mimicked by the bear''s fur, using black and white.  Smart~~8', '2005-11-28 08:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901777, 262284, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice tack sharp focus and interesting perspective. The blue of the sky really works. Not a fan of stuffed animals in a shot, but considering the reasoning behind it, it works and explains the shot. Very nicely done. 8</td>', 'Nice tack sharp focus and interesting perspective. The blue of the sky really works. Not a fan of stuffed animals in a shot, but considering the reasoning behind it, it works and explains the shot. Very nicely done. 8', '2005-11-28 08:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901779, 262201, 15711, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this works. Great detail of the weave of the tie. I like the askew sense of it like coming home and just throwing it off. It works well in combination with an excellent title.</td>', 'The simplicity of this works. Great detail of the weave of the tie. I like the askew sense of it like coming home and just throwing it off. It works well in combination with an excellent title.', '2005-11-28 08:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901781, 262756, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yippee - a potty shot! This is well done and I like the "leaning tower of toilet products." LOL  The purpled sepia works well for this.  GOod perspective. 7</td>', 'Yippee - a potty shot! This is well done and I like the "leaning tower of toilet products." LOL  The purpled sepia works well for this.  GOod perspective. 7', '2005-11-28 08:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901786, 262766, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has perfect symmetry and is quite visually appealing even before you  realize it was a weekly pill dispenser. What makes it fun is that although the pills are all identical, they aren''t in the exact same position so it breaks up the monotony. The frame caps it off.</td>', 'This has perfect symmetry and is quite visually appealing even before you  realize it was a weekly pill dispenser. What makes it fun is that although the pills are all identical, they aren''t in the exact same position so it breaks up the monotony. The frame caps it off.', '2005-11-28 08:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901787, 262704, 15711, '<td valign="top">What makes this shot for me is the aged filter. The tight cropk works too, along with the perspective. The dim lighting skims over the table, chair and shoes, and makes you take a 2nd look. 7</td>', 'What makes this shot for me is the aged filter. The tight cropk works too, along with the perspective. The dim lighting skims over the table, chair and shoes, and makes you take a 2nd look. 7', '2005-11-28 08:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901790, 262153, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is like a wind tunnel.  I like the symmetry and unusual take on this challenge.</td>', 'This is like a wind tunnel.  I like the symmetry and unusual take on this challenge.', '2005-11-28 08:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1901810, 262517, 46586, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the circles ont the left and I think the colors could have been warmer...I have also a strange feeling of slightly out of focus...</td>', 'I don''t like the circles ont the left and I think the colors could have been warmer...I have also a strange feeling of slightly out of focus...', '2005-11-28 08:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
