(1902725, 262780, 40718, '<td valign="top">Could have been a ribbon winner in my mind if the focus and lighting were superior.  It seems like the focus is slightly off (see phone) and the color of the laundry dispenser is garish.  Still I gave it a 7 and that''s pretty good in this challenge.</td>', 'Could have been a ribbon winner in my mind if the focus and lighting were superior.  It seems like the focus is slightly off (see phone) and the color of the laundry dispenser is garish.  Still I gave it a 7 and that''s pretty good in this challenge.', '2005-11-28 17:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902728, 262100, 40718, '<td valign="top">How about "It''s a dog eat dog world"?  The setup and exposure are excellent here.  Should ribbon in this small challenge.  I only rated one other pic as highly.</td>', 'How about "It''s a dog eat dog world"?  The setup and exposure are excellent here.  Should ribbon in this small challenge.  I only rated one other pic as highly.', '2005-11-28 17:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902730, 262569, 40718, '<td valign="top">classic.  Ribbon in my book.  I would nitpick about the tone.  It''s not my favorite, but the rest is excellent.</td>', 'classic.  Ribbon in my book.  I would nitpick about the tone.  It''s not my favorite, but the rest is excellent.', '2005-11-28 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902732, 262789, 48549, '<td valign="top">Very nice night shot</td>', 'Very nice night shot', '2005-11-28 17:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902747, 262478, 42714, '<td valign="top">You''ll notice that on many interior photographs there''s a yellow tint that didn''t appear to be there when you shot the picture.  You can rectify this in two ways - one, is to use an 82A blue filter to cancel out that light.  The other is use a saturation layer to tone down those yellows. :)  Good composition, though I think this might be stronger if the photo focused exclusively on the shoe, bra, and bed corner.  It simplifies the composition and gives benefit of more detail in your photo.</td>', 'You''ll notice that on many interior photographs there''s a yellow tint that didn''t appear to be there when you shot the picture.  You can rectify this in two ways - one, is to use an 82A blue filter to cancel out that light.  The other is use a saturation layer to tone down those yellows. :)  Good composition, though I think this might be stronger if the photo focused exclusively on the shoe, bra, and bed corner.  It simplifies the composition and gives benefit of more detail in your photo.', '2005-11-28 17:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902748, 262761, 42714, '<td valign="top">Great metaphor to marriage.  Good composition  Something about the focus and digital noise bothers me though.</td>', 'Great metaphor to marriage.  Good composition  Something about the focus and digital noise bothers me though.', '2005-11-28 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902750, 262594, 35804, '<td valign="top">...hehehe   : }  big boy toys... now that''s gettin'' in the spirit of things! And I have to say thanks for being original...no booze, condoms, pills or bills...very refreshing.</td>', '...hehehe   : }  big boy toys... now that''s gettin'' in the spirit of things! And I have to say thanks for being original...no booze, condoms, pills or bills...very refreshing.', '2005-11-28 17:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902752, 262488, 42714, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Good graphic composition and great use of natural lighting (and if this isn''t natural, great way to immitate it) to illuminate your object.</td>', 'I love this.  Good graphic composition and great use of natural lighting (and if this isn''t natural, great way to immitate it) to illuminate your object.', '2005-11-28 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902768, 262688, 42714, '<td valign="top">I have to question how, without the title, this would fit into the theme, but I simply adore your manipulation of scale in this photograph.</td>', 'I have to question how, without the title, this would fit into the theme, but I simply adore your manipulation of scale in this photograph.', '2005-11-28 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902772, 262577, 42714, '<td valign="top">This is suffering from a bit of underexposure.  Would recommend playing with your level adjustment layers to brighten it up a bit. :)</td>', 'This is suffering from a bit of underexposure.  Would recommend playing with your level adjustment layers to brighten it up a bit. :)', '2005-11-28 17:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902774, 262683, 42714, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this idea, but think it would''ve benefited from a little more light. Again, love the simplicity and DOF.</td>', 'I LOVE this idea, but think it would''ve benefited from a little more light. Again, love the simplicity and DOF.', '2005-11-28 17:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902785, 262716, 42714, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this was unintentional (or not!), but the way you presented this horizontally adds a phallic nature which I think blends into the theme.  Compositionally and technically, a great B&amp;W photo, with what appears to have just enough tone.</td>', 'I''m sure this was unintentional (or not!), but the way you presented this horizontally adds a phallic nature which I think blends into the theme.  Compositionally and technically, a great B&W photo, with what appears to have just enough tone.', '2005-11-28 17:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902792, 262649, 42714, '<td valign="top">Props for the laugh.  Technically, it''s a bit underexposed and judging from the billboard in comparison to the border, seems just a bit tilted.</td>', 'Props for the laugh.  Technically, it''s a bit underexposed and judging from the billboard in comparison to the border, seems just a bit tilted.', '2005-11-28 17:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902800, 262201, 42714, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and color...I question if maybe you did a bit too much editing...I''m noticing some major noise and unnatural color variation around the tie, looks like some magic wand use was done here.</td>', 'Love the composition and color...I question if maybe you did a bit too much editing...I''m noticing some major noise and unnatural color variation around the tie, looks like some magic wand use was done here.', '2005-11-28 17:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902802, 262515, 42714, '<td valign="top">Seen a bunch of these, but this is the best I''ve seen both compositionally and technically.  Great color coordination.</td>', 'Seen a bunch of these, but this is the best I''ve seen both compositionally and technically.  Great color coordination.', '2005-11-28 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902804, 262789, 42714, '<td valign="top">Urban shots are difficult because of obstructions.  I think the vehicle in the bottom left hand corner draws your eye more than anything here.</td>', 'Urban shots are difficult because of obstructions.  I think the vehicle in the bottom left hand corner draws your eye more than anything here.', '2005-11-28 17:34:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1902818, 261887, 42714, '<td valign="top">Just priceless.  It''s surprisingly difficult to get the proper exposure with a covered lamp, but you''ve done it here.</td>', 'Just priceless.  It''s surprisingly difficult to get the proper exposure with a covered lamp, but you''ve done it here.', '2005-11-28 17:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902829, 262488, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the angle of this shot.  lovely lighting on the vacuum and floor.  the house just looks so clean!  the image leaves me wondering what was it the adult had to clean up?</td>', 'like the angle of this shot.  lovely lighting on the vacuum and floor.  the house just looks so clean!  the image leaves me wondering what was it the adult had to clean up?', '2005-11-28 17:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902830, 261990, 37875, '<td valign="top">love the little blue ones with the fleece...<br/>while the lighting gives this photo a snapshot feel, it''s a charming composition that evokes the feeling of family.  very sweet.</td>', 'love the little blue ones with the fleece...while the lighting gives this photo a snapshot feel, it''s a charming composition that evokes the feeling of family.  very sweet.', '2005-11-28 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902831, 262478, 37875, '<td valign="top">lovely yellow light in this photo.  like the simplicity of the composition.</td>', 'lovely yellow light in this photo.  like the simplicity of the composition.', '2005-11-28 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902832, 262704, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a great composition and color treatment.  there''s somthing blurring by the boots which is a bit distracting, but a very nice photo.</td>', 'what a great composition and color treatment.  there''s somthing blurring by the boots which is a bit distracting, but a very nice photo.', '2005-11-28 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902833, 262603, 37875, '<td valign="top">wish there wasn''t something visible printed on the other side of the glass, as it distracts my eye from the rest of the photo.  this is a nicely composed shot, with a good sense of humor!</td>', 'wish there wasn''t something visible printed on the other side of the glass, as it distracts my eye from the rest of the photo.  this is a nicely composed shot, with a good sense of humor!', '2005-11-28 17:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902834, 261616, 37875, '<td valign="top">a very nice, simple composition that''s a good fit for this challenge.  i feel like the bill itself is out of focus, but that may be my tired old eyes...<br/>; )<br/></td>', 'a very nice, simple composition that''s a good fit for this challenge.  i feel like the bill itself is out of focus, but that may be my tired old eyes...; )', '2005-11-28 17:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902835, 262669, 37875, '<td valign="top">ah, those abandoned playthings of childhood.<br/>like how the snow adds to the abandonedness of the photo''s feel.  very nice b&amp;w.</td>', 'ah, those abandoned playthings of childhood.like how the snow adds to the abandonedness of the photo''s feel.  very nice b&w.', '2005-11-28 17:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902836, 262547, 37875, '<td valign="top">made me smile!  cute composition...nice dof.</td>', 'made me smile!  cute composition...nice dof.', '2005-11-28 17:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902837, 261234, 37875, '<td valign="top">in terms of composition, the photo is not that exciting to me.  however, the hour of day really lends an extrordinary blue cast to the photo, which is interesting.</td>', 'in terms of composition, the photo is not that exciting to me.  however, the hour of day really lends an extrordinary blue cast to the photo, which is interesting.', '2005-11-28 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902838, 262201, 37875, '<td valign="top">a classic, simple composition that''s very appropriate for this challenge.  the brown stuff under the left part of the tie detracts from the photo, and it''s a shame because this image''s simplicity would have made it a contender in my book.</td>', 'a classic, simple composition that''s very appropriate for this challenge.  the brown stuff under the left part of the tie detracts from the photo, and it''s a shame because this image''s simplicity would have made it a contender in my book.', '2005-11-28 17:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902839, 262517, 37875, '<td valign="top">i would have liked to see more of the amber tones played up in this photo as opposed to the reds. perhaps a black background would allow those reds and ambers to sing more in the photo.  also, the light source is reflecting a lamp in your glass, and bouncing your light may help avoid this.<br/>as an adult, i have acquired a taste for v.s.o.p. and am happy to see this tasty marker of adulthood included in this challenge!</td>', 'i would have liked to see more of the amber tones played up in this photo as opposed to the reds. perhaps a black background would allow those reds and ambers to sing more in the photo.  also, the light source is reflecting a lamp in your glass, and bouncing your light may help avoid this.as an adult, i have acquired a taste for v.s.o.p. and am happy to see this tasty marker of adulthood included in this challenge!', '2005-11-28 17:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902840, 262365, 37875, '<td valign="top">i like the harshness of the white and red in this image.  it really adds to that "one too many" feeling...</td>', 'i like the harshness of the white and red in this image.  it really adds to that "one too many" feeling...', '2005-11-28 17:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902841, 262408, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a beautiful child!  like the composition for this image.</td>', 'such a beautiful child!  like the composition for this image.', '2005-11-28 17:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902842, 262613, 37875, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous.  how did you achieve this feel to your b&amp;w treatment?</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous.  how did you achieve this feel to your b&w treatment?', '2005-11-28 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902843, 262649, 37875, '<td valign="top">the sign feels like it''s leaning a bit to the left to me...<br/>classic subject for this challenge!</td>', 'the sign feels like it''s leaning a bit to the left to me...classic subject for this challenge!', '2005-11-28 17:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902844, 262759, 37875, '<td valign="top">boy can i relate to this one!  : )<br/>nice soft lighting and soft focus.  wish "christmas list" was in focus when i look at this...but the softness of focus really adds to the whole feeling of overwhelm/holiday haze.</td>', 'boy can i relate to this one!  : )nice soft lighting and soft focus.  wish "christmas list" was in focus when i look at this...but the softness of focus really adds to the whole feeling of overwhelm/holiday haze.', '2005-11-28 17:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902845, 262566, 37875, '<td valign="top">ooh, love the photo and the title!  great composition, colors, and dof.</td>', 'ooh, love the photo and the title!  great composition, colors, and dof.', '2005-11-28 17:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902846, 262438, 37875, '<td valign="top">a lovely photo and appropriate sentiment.  like the b&amp;w treatment very much.</td>', 'a lovely photo and appropriate sentiment.  like the b&w treatment very much.', '2005-11-28 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902847, 262334, 37875, '<td valign="top">i love the expression, it really emphasizes the youthfulness of the model.</td>', 'i love the expression, it really emphasizes the youthfulness of the model.', '2005-11-28 17:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902848, 262539, 37875, '<td valign="top">what great light in this composition!  the photo has a soft, dreamy feeling as a result, which adds to that longing referenced in the title.</td>', 'what great light in this composition!  the photo has a soft, dreamy feeling as a result, which adds to that longing referenced in the title.', '2005-11-28 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902849, 262773, 37875, '<td valign="top">made me smile, and boy can i relate to that one!  i would have liked to see this shot taken with different lighting to reduce the snapshot feel, but it''s a great photo concept for this challenge!</td>', 'made me smile, and boy can i relate to that one!  i would have liked to see this shot taken with different lighting to reduce the snapshot feel, but it''s a great photo concept for this challenge!', '2005-11-28 17:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902850, 262283, 37875, '<td valign="top">great composition and photo idea for this challenge.  i''m impressed at the "citizen" prescription, as well!  nicely done.</td>', 'great composition and photo idea for this challenge.  i''m impressed at the "citizen" prescription, as well!  nicely done.', '2005-11-28 17:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902851, 261750, 37875, '<td valign="top">cute idea!  nicely composed and lit.</td>', 'cute idea!  nicely composed and lit.', '2005-11-28 17:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902852, 262673, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the door and composition.  would have liked to see this without the selective desaturation...not sure what leaving color in the leaves adds to the photo.</td>', 'like the door and composition.  would have liked to see this without the selective desaturation...not sure what leaving color in the leaves adds to the photo.', '2005-11-28 17:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902853, 262382, 37875, '<td valign="top">the image appears to be a bit heavy in the darker tonal range, to the point where the viewer loses detail on the roof and in the foremost branches.  it''s a great composition with lots of interesting texture and lines.</td>', 'the image appears to be a bit heavy in the darker tonal range, to the point where the viewer loses detail on the roof and in the foremost branches.  it''s a great composition with lots of interesting texture and lines.', '2005-11-28 17:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902855, 262459, 37875, '<td valign="top">this image would pop more with different lighting.  lighting at an angle would help emphasize the shape of the bottle and glass, and a backlight could help draw out the color of the wine.</td>', 'this image would pop more with different lighting.  lighting at an angle would help emphasize the shape of the bottle and glass, and a backlight could help draw out the color of the wine.', '2005-11-28 17:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902856, 262636, 37875, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  i love this!  the background makes the bears appear to be floating in space, so i think i''d like to see the background be a bit different, but otherwise i think it''s awesome!</td>', 'LOL!!!  i love this!  the background makes the bears appear to be floating in space, so i think i''d like to see the background be a bit different, but otherwise i think it''s awesome!', '2005-11-28 17:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902860, 262314, 36692, '<td valign="top">What a cute cop!!!</td>', 'What a cute cop!!!', '2005-11-28 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902868, 262123, 34013, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.</td>', 'beautiful shot.', '2005-11-28 17:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902869, 261383, 37875, '<td valign="top">great image!  love the grainy texture of the room and bear.</td>', 'great image!  love the grainy texture of the room and bear.', '2005-11-28 17:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902870, 262510, 37875, '<td valign="top">striking eyes.</td>', 'striking eyes.', '2005-11-28 17:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902871, 261175, 34013, '<td valign="top">really cool shot!</td>', 'really cool shot!', '2005-11-28 17:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902872, 262574, 37875, '<td valign="top">great textures and colors in this image!  it''s interesting how the logs blend in to the ground...</td>', 'great textures and colors in this image!  it''s interesting how the logs blend in to the ground...', '2005-11-28 17:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902873, 262284, 37875, '<td valign="top">what an interesting shot--perspective-wise and lighting-wise.</td>', 'what an interesting shot--perspective-wise and lighting-wise.', '2005-11-28 17:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902874, 262789, 37875, '<td valign="top">wish your neon weren''t as blown out on the Hustler sign...can''t quite read what it says.<br/>groovy composition and a great idea for this challenge.</td>', 'wish your neon weren''t as blown out on the Hustler sign...can''t quite read what it says.groovy composition and a great idea for this challenge.', '2005-11-28 17:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902875, 262571, 37875, '<td valign="top">this shot really appeals to me for this challenge.  the brights are overly-bright for me (e.g. light reflection off bike chrome), but the composition and vivid colors really work well.</td>', 'this shot really appeals to me for this challenge.  the brights are overly-bright for me (e.g. light reflection off bike chrome), but the composition and vivid colors really work well.', '2005-11-28 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902876, 261887, 37875, '<td valign="top">a simple composition, nicely lit, that made me smile!</td>', 'a simple composition, nicely lit, that made me smile!', '2005-11-28 17:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902877, 261657, 37875, '<td valign="top">that darn road construction!  definately an adult punishment!  : )<br/>the turn signs at the top of the image are a bit bright to my eye.  i also wonder if there is another way to capture this idea while lending greater visual excitement, like through the choice of perspective or composition.</td>', 'that darn road construction!  definately an adult punishment!  : )the turn signs at the top of the image are a bit bright to my eye.  i also wonder if there is another way to capture this idea while lending greater visual excitement, like through the choice of perspective or composition.', '2005-11-28 17:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902878, 262724, 37875, '<td valign="top">such a charming face and smile!  great idea for this challenge, with the adult teeth starting to come in.  the face has some redness on the chin and forehead that would have been nice to edit out just a bit.  such a great, happy, expression...makes me smile just to look at her!</td>', 'such a charming face and smile!  great idea for this challenge, with the adult teeth starting to come in.  the face has some redness on the chin and forehead that would have been nice to edit out just a bit.  such a great, happy, expression...makes me smile just to look at her!', '2005-11-28 17:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902881, 262716, 37875, '<td valign="top">interesting angle for display...lends a bit of a sinister feel to that handle!</td>', 'interesting angle for display...lends a bit of a sinister feel to that handle!', '2005-11-28 17:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902882, 262169, 37875, '<td valign="top">nicely composed car shot!  would have loved to see this taken at sunset for richer light and reflections...<br/>i have to say, though, that the title implies "teenage boy" more than "adult" to me with this image.</td>', 'nicely composed car shot!  would have loved to see this taken at sunset for richer light and reflections...i have to say, though, that the title implies "teenage boy" more than "adult" to me with this image.', '2005-11-28 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902883, 262212, 37875, '<td valign="top">lol! love the composition and idea!</td>', 'lol! love the composition and idea!', '2005-11-28 17:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902884, 262726, 37875, '<td valign="top">a lovely photo.  like the grain and choice of color treatment.  the title feels a bit heavy for this child to carry, though.</td>', 'a lovely photo.  like the grain and choice of color treatment.  the title feels a bit heavy for this child to carry, though.', '2005-11-28 17:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902885, 262314, 37875, '<td valign="top">great angle and colors in the kids. cute composition.</td>', 'great angle and colors in the kids. cute composition.', '2005-11-28 17:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902886, 262778, 34013, '<td valign="top">lol! really funny yet true take on this challenge.</td>', 'lol! really funny yet true take on this challenge.', '2005-11-28 17:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902887, 262041, 37875, '<td valign="top">the lighting on the wine bottle''s label is a bit bright, washing it out a bit.  like the composition of this image.</td>', 'the lighting on the wine bottle''s label is a bit bright, washing it out a bit.  like the composition of this image.', '2005-11-28 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902888, 262755, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the softness of this photo''s lighting and the rich browns.</td>', 'like the softness of this photo''s lighting and the rich browns.', '2005-11-28 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902889, 262702, 37875, '<td valign="top">nicely shot!  i wish the headline would have been more meaningful in relation to the image.</td>', 'nicely shot!  i wish the headline would have been more meaningful in relation to the image.', '2005-11-28 17:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902890, 262136, 37875, '<td valign="top">i''d rather see the image rotated and cropped for this effect, imo.<br/>great idea for this challenge.  nice colors and textures in the image.</td>', 'i''d rather see the image rotated and cropped for this effect, imo.great idea for this challenge.  nice colors and textures in the image.', '2005-11-28 17:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902891, 260328, 37875, '<td valign="top">like the angle of this shot.  the flat-tone b&amp;w treatment gives the image a sort of journalistic feel.</td>', 'like the angle of this shot.  the flat-tone b&w treatment gives the image a sort of journalistic feel.', '2005-11-28 17:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902892, 262783, 37875, '<td valign="top">lovely scene...i wouldn''t mind exploring that open road!  like the natural light for this shot as well.</td>', 'lovely scene...i wouldn''t mind exploring that open road!  like the natural light for this shot as well.', '2005-11-28 17:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902893, 262766, 37875, '<td valign="top">fabulous shot.  love the colors of the pills against the aged pill dispenser.  makes for an attractive photo.  well done.</td>', 'fabulous shot.  love the colors of the pills against the aged pill dispenser.  makes for an attractive photo.  well done.', '2005-11-28 17:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902894, 262270, 37875, '<td valign="top">great lines and structure to this photo.  the b&amp;w works well.  it''s the modern day version of the starter home!</td>', 'great lines and structure to this photo.  the b&w works well.  it''s the modern day version of the starter home!', '2005-11-28 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902895, 262654, 37875, '<td valign="top">great idea!  dad always carves at the big meals...<br/>that round mole-looking spot on the ham is a bit distracting to my eye...i would be interested in seeing the shot without it.</td>', 'great idea!  dad always carves at the big meals...that round mole-looking spot on the ham is a bit distracting to my eye...i would be interested in seeing the shot without it.', '2005-11-28 17:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902896, 262653, 37875, '<td valign="top">great idea for this challenge!  effective photo with interesting composition and good lighting.  nicely done!</td>', 'great idea for this challenge!  effective photo with interesting composition and good lighting.  nicely done!', '2005-11-28 17:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1902897, 262656, 37875, '<td valign="top">nice composition, great lighting effect, like the color choices.  i really like the barbie in the shoebox.  i do have to say that there is one thing that bothers me about this photo: to write this comment i am given a view up that small child''s skirt, and that makes me feel a bit uncomfortable as a viewer. i realize that this is not the intent of the photo, but i wanted to bring it to your attention.</td>', 'nice composition, great lighting effect, like the color choices.  i really like the barbie in the shoebox.  i do have to say that there is one thing that bothers me about this photo: to write this comment i am given a view up that small child''s skirt, and that makes me feel a bit uncomfortable as a viewer. i realize that this is not the intent of the photo, but i wanted to bring it to your attention.', '2005-11-28 17:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
