(1903141, 262427, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think you have a good concept. The photo seems a bit pixelated on my screen, and a bit too magenta. Since the bills and checkbook are horizontal elements, I wonder how something like this would look as a horizontal photo rather than vertical.</td>', 'I think you have a good concept. The photo seems a bit pixelated on my screen, and a bit too magenta. Since the bills and checkbook are horizontal elements, I wonder how something like this would look as a horizontal photo rather than vertical.', '2005-11-28 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
