(1903388, 262702, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very fitting to the challenge (partcularily as I view this with my readers hanging around my neck). Good use of what I believe is  gaussian blur effect, B/W very effective. Nice workand good luck on this myopic submission -8-</td>', 'Very fitting to the challenge (partcularily as I view this with my readers hanging around my neck). Good use of what I believe is  gaussian blur effect, B/W very effective. Nice workand good luck on this myopic submission -8-', '2005-11-28 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
