(1903406, 262459, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice subdued look to separate it from the mundane. The composition and execution are very fine, indeed.</td>', 'Very nice subdued look to separate it from the mundane. The composition and execution are very fine, indeed.', '2005-11-28 21:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
