(1903489, 262706, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, like the color choice of bg to accent the diamond and the use of the curve. Good luck on these symbols of adulthood. -8-</td>', 'Nice lighting, like the color choice of bg to accent the diamond and the use of the curve. Good luck on these symbols of adulthood. -8-', '2005-11-28 21:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903494, 262625, 24846, '<td valign="top">I bet you groaned when you saw the knife challenge pop up this morning. Great use of stainless here though. Like blue bg and edge glow, nice composition with thin to thick blades and the curve effect of thirds, Good luck on this sharp image and I look forward to your next submission in spoon, knife, and fork. -8-</td>', 'I bet you groaned when you saw the knife challenge pop up this morning. Great use of stainless here though. Like blue bg and edge glow, nice composition with thin to thick blades and the curve effect of thirds, Good luck on this sharp image and I look forward to your next submission in spoon, knife, and fork. -8-', '2005-11-28 21:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903499, 262704, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice cozy shot. Like the composition, eyes drawn from chair to fire to table. and then shoes, Good luck on this cracklin image. -9-</td>', 'Nice cozy shot. Like the composition, eyes drawn from chair to fire to table. and then shoes, Good luck on this cracklin image. -9-', '2005-11-28 21:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903518, 262113, 24846, '<td valign="top">This silky image draws me back, simple yet sophisticated. Great emotive feel here, The curves in the fabric are nicely displayed in thirds with a soft edge of light on each. Good luck on this carressing picture.</td>', 'This silky image draws me back, simple yet sophisticated. Great emotive feel here, The curves in the fabric are nicely displayed in thirds with a soft edge of light on each. Good luck on this carressing picture.', '2005-11-28 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
