(1903726, 262704, 44687, '<td valign="top">Not only does this photograph capture the essence of \"adulthood without adults\", it is a very pleasing photo to look at......Gives off a feeling of warmth. Definately a seller!</td>', 'Not only does this photograph capture the essence of \"adulthood without adults\", it is a very pleasing photo to look at......Gives off a feeling of warmth. Definately a seller!', '2005-11-28 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
