(1903849, 262334, 39349, '<td valign="top">This feels too much like a snapshot to me, but I''m not saying this is a bad photo. I''m just not getting a connection to the subject. Or an explanation as to why she''s dressing up to look like she''s 21. Maybe trying different surroundings or do more of a portrait setup would improve this shot IMHO.</td>', 'This feels too much like a snapshot to me, but I''m not saying this is a bad photo. I''m just not getting a connection to the subject. Or an explanation as to why she''s dressing up to look like she''s 21. Maybe trying different surroundings or do more of a portrait setup would improve this shot IMHO.', '2005-11-29 01:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903852, 262569, 39349, '<td valign="top">Tones seem a bit flat to me. I''m a sucker for contrast though. Good execution on a symbolic idea.</td>', 'Tones seem a bit flat to me. I''m a sucker for contrast though. Good execution on a symbolic idea.', '2005-11-29 02:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1903854, 261175, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good Bubbles challenge, not so sure about adulthood</td>', 'Good Bubbles challenge, not so sure about adulthood', '2005-11-29 02:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
