(1904542, 262041, 42984, '<td valign="top">Being legally able to have sex is one of the strong rights of adulthood passage, maybe the strongest.  Yet as a group we have not addressed this in the challenge because its so difficult to do. You''ve done it tastefully. Tecnically, the bottle label is overexposed a little too much and perhaps the top left is a little cluttered in composition. Personal preference would be not to have the bottle at anything but straight</td>', 'Being legally able to have sex is one of the strong rights of adulthood passage, maybe the strongest.  Yet as a group we have not addressed this in the challenge because its so difficult to do. You''ve done it tastefully. Tecnically, the bottle label is overexposed a little too much and perhaps the top left is a little cluttered in composition. Personal preference would be not to have the bottle at anything but straight', '2005-11-29 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
