(1911555, 262566, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture but I am having a hard time connecting the title. I assume I am missing something so it didn''t affect your score. Love the greens here.</td>', 'Very nice picture but I am having a hard time connecting the title. I assume I am missing something so it didn''t affect your score. Love the greens here.', '2005-12-01 08:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
