(1914988, 262478, 48938, '<td valign="top">good photo..  bit to yellowish for me.. i know its supposed to be mood lighting but overall its good.</td>', 'good photo..  bit to yellowish for me.. i know its supposed to be mood lighting but overall its good.', '2005-12-02 01:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915295, 262637, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but two things drag it down to mediocre for my part.  1.  The wheel up in the right corner is just plain distracting, if it´s your car I would have gone through the trouble of moving it, if it´s not I would have gone so far as to find another angle too shoot from.  2.  Actually the angle of the shot makes this seem "snapshot-like", it isn´t very interesting and just makes me want to klick that "5" and move on to the next shot.  How about experimenting with another angle, like shooting from the ground and upwards at a really wide angle or just something a little bit more unorthodox.  5 from me.</td>', 'Not bad but two things drag it down to mediocre for my part.  1.  The wheel up in the right corner is just plain distracting, if it´s your car I would have gone through the trouble of moving it, if it´s not I would have gone so far as to find another angle too shoot from.  2.  Actually the angle of the shot makes this seem "snapshot-like", it isn´t very interesting and just makes me want to klick that "5" and move on to the next shot.  How about experimenting with another angle, like shooting from the ground and upwards at a really wide angle or just something a little bit more unorthodox.  5 from me.', '2005-12-02 03:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915299, 262787, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lightpainting but the rest falls a little short, the wignetted lighting isn´t really appealing to me and the image could juse some more sharpness.  Above average in the challenge, I gave it a 6.</td>', 'Nice job with the lightpainting but the rest falls a little short, the wignetted lighting isn´t really appealing to me and the image could juse some more sharpness.  Above average in the challenge, I gave it a 6.', '2005-12-02 03:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915304, 262688, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool, took me a second to realize it was a miniature.  I don´t understand what that truck is doing there though, what has canadian beef to do with anything? :)<br/> <br/>Anyway, nice shot, good lighting, technically it´s good but it just lacks something, a "wow" factor to make me want to give it more than a 6.</td>', 'Cool, took me a second to realize it was a miniature.  I don´t understand what that truck is doing there though, what has canadian beef to do with anything? :) Anyway, nice shot, good lighting, technically it´s good but it just lacks something, a "wow" factor to make me want to give it more than a 6.', '2005-12-02 04:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915306, 262438, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, nice job on the b/w conversion, great tones in it and the composition and DOF is pretty good.  Would have given this a good score but it just is so completely off topic that I ended up giving it a 3.</td>', 'I like this shot, nice job on the b/w conversion, great tones in it and the composition and DOF is pretty good.  Would have given this a good score but it just is so completely off topic that I ended up giving it a 3.', '2005-12-02 04:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915307, 262613, 27482, '<td valign="top">A little too much dodge/burn (or whatever you used to darken the sky) for my taste.  Also not really fond of the clipping of the smoke and lower part of the factory but you seem to know what you are doing so I just assume there is nothing to the right or bottom that is worth seeing.  7 from me.</td>', 'A little too much dodge/burn (or whatever you used to darken the sky) for my taste.  Also not really fond of the clipping of the smoke and lower part of the factory but you seem to know what you are doing so I just assume there is nothing to the right or bottom that is worth seeing.  7 from me.', '2005-12-02 04:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915399, 262065, 39349, '<td valign="top">Creative and fresh take in this challenge. For that I must commend you on. Picture has good tones and I like your choice of DOF. Now how''d you charm the snake?</td>', 'Creative and fresh take in this challenge. For that I must commend you on. Picture has good tones and I like your choice of DOF. Now how''d you charm the snake?', '2005-12-02 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915406, 262478, 39349, '<td valign="top">This shot at first to me seemed very simple, BUT after going back over my votes I truly was pulled into this because of it''s simple subject and amazing tonal range. I really like how the yellow and orange tones create a warm and inviting feeling that pulls the viewers imagination into the shot. It creates an intimate and sensual feeling without having to show two people at all. Wonderful job! 10</td>', 'This shot at first to me seemed very simple, BUT after going back over my votes I truly was pulled into this because of it''s simple subject and amazing tonal range. I really like how the yellow and orange tones create a warm and inviting feeling that pulls the viewers imagination into the shot. It creates an intimate and sensual feeling without having to show two people at all. Wonderful job! 10', '2005-12-02 07:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915410, 262438, 39349, '<td valign="top">I''m really drawn into this shot. I really like your even tones and I''m really impressed how you''ve captured a seemingly nature vignette with the darker tones around the sides of the frame to pull the viewers eyes to focus on your beautiful model. Nicely done.</td>', 'I''m really drawn into this shot. I really like your even tones and I''m really impressed how you''ve captured a seemingly nature vignette with the darker tones around the sides of the frame to pull the viewers eyes to focus on your beautiful model. Nicely done.', '2005-12-02 07:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1915414, 262706, 39349, '<td valign="top">Simple and a well done. It does seem a tad out of focus but to me that adds a soothing and ethereal feeling to this shot. Well done.</td>', 'Simple and a well done. It does seem a tad out of focus but to me that adds a soothing and ethereal feeling to this shot. Well done.', '2005-12-02 07:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
