(1916117, 262716, 27482, '<td valign="top">Can´t put my finger on it but I like the shot, very odd somehow in that I am not sure how this gimmick works and wether it is shot at a 90 degree angle or what is really up and down in the image but still without a sense of uncomfortable vertigo.  Good job, 7 from me.</td>', 'Can´t put my finger on it but I like the shot, very odd somehow in that I am not sure how this gimmick works and wether it is shot at a 90 degree angle or what is really up and down in the image but still without a sense of uncomfortable vertigo.  Good job, 7 from me.', '2005-12-02 12:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916301, 262212, 18799, '<td valign="top">Perfect!   The thought that went into the storyboard for this image is evident.  10<br/>Back after reviewing all the photos in this challenge - this is my winner.</td>', 'Perfect!   The thought that went into the storyboard for this image is evident.  10Back after reviewing all the photos in this challenge - this is my winner.', '2005-12-02 13:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916424, 261243, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the concept and colors.  Criticism; if it were either straight and symmetrical or even on the diagonal but ''balanced'', make this even better in my opinion.  A little more focus/sharpness too, and seems a variation in lighting may have also helped.  Like the ''appearance'' of depth behind the medals.</td>', '7 - Like the concept and colors.  Criticism; if it were either straight and symmetrical or even on the diagonal but ''balanced'', make this even better in my opinion.  A little more focus/sharpness too, and seems a variation in lighting may have also helped.  Like the ''appearance'' of depth behind the medals.', '2005-12-02 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916430, 262755, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice simple colors and composition.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a little sharper ''somewhere'', the pen maybe, who knows.  Maybe wider may have also helped this, incorporating the wallet(?) more too, to make this even better.</td>', '7 - Nice simple colors and composition.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a little sharper ''somewhere'', the pen maybe, who knows.  Maybe wider may have also helped this, incorporating the wallet(?) more too, to make this even better.', '2005-12-02 14:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916435, 262706, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this, nice composition and lighting.  Criticism; Although it looks like you''ve gone for a ''soft look/feel'' to this, I think if either the stone or pattern on the ring were in sharper focus, or a variation in lighting, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Like this, nice composition and lighting.  Criticism; Although it looks like you''ve gone for a ''soft look/feel'' to this, I think if either the stone or pattern on the ring were in sharper focus, or a variation in lighting, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-02 14:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916441, 262768, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the perspective.  Criticism; like to see even more ''Metamucil'' powder, perhaps even using the texture of it to add something extra here.  Like to also see it 640.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '7 - Like the perspective.  Criticism; like to see even more ''Metamucil'' powder, perhaps even using the texture of it to add something extra here.  Like to also see it 640.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-12-02 14:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916447, 262153, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good execution, seemingly.  Criticism; needs a slight nudge rotation up on the right.  Depending how you did this, just for added effect, more movement if possible on the ''outside'', sharper too of course on the ''inside'', would have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe the gearshift/stick incorporated more instead of half chopped off, as doesn''t seem you could eliminate it because of the steering wheel.</td>', '7 - Good execution, seemingly.  Criticism; needs a slight nudge rotation up on the right.  Depending how you did this, just for added effect, more movement if possible on the ''outside'', sharper too of course on the ''inside'', would have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe the gearshift/stick incorporated more instead of half chopped off, as doesn''t seem you could eliminate it because of the steering wheel.', '2005-12-02 14:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916454, 262704, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this concept.  Criticism; like to see more context here and ''further out'', cropping or zoom; more of the chair, table, etc.  It also looks slightly ''off'' so perhaps a nudge rotation up on the right, and more ''balance'' in the composition, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Toning works well, even though a bit ''hard'' in places.  Seems an ''issue'' bottom fore to the right, ''something'' there in front of the boots. edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-05 07:06:08.</i></td>', '6 - Like this concept.  Criticism; like to see more context here and ''further out'', cropping or zoom; more of the chair, table, etc.  It also looks slightly ''off'' so perhaps a nudge rotation up on the right, and more ''balance'' in the composition, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Toning works well, even though a bit ''hard'' in places.  Seems an ''issue'' bottom fore to the right, ''something'' there in front of the boots. edit:typos', '2005-12-02 14:41:25.000000', '2005-12-05 07:06:08.000000', 1),
(1916461, 262775, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  A lot of context.  Criticism; slightly different arrangement/composition (for more balance), better focus/sharpness on at least a few items, the lighting adjusted, would all have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Like this.  A lot of context.  Criticism; slightly different arrangement/composition (for more balance), better focus/sharpness on at least a few items, the lighting adjusted, would all have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-02 14:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1916473, 261887, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this, nice and simple.  Criticism; to nit-pick, too much water in the glass with the teeth.  Perhaps moving the glasses slightly so as to not get that reflection, or otherwise ''use it'' more for effect, may have made this better in my opinion.  Just noticed (2nd look) the ''spritz/bubbles/fizz'' at the top of the glass with the ''Seltzer'', could have used this more for added effect also, ''somehow'', maybe shorter glass and under the light, who knows. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-05 07:05:37.</i></td>', '7 - Like this, nice and simple.  Criticism; to nit-pick, too much water in the glass with the teeth.  Perhaps moving the glasses slightly so as to not get that reflection, or otherwise ''use it'' more for effect, may have made this better in my opinion.  Just noticed (2nd look) the ''spritz/bubbles/fizz'' at the top of the glass with the ''Seltzer'', could have used this more for added effect also, ''somehow'', maybe shorter glass and under the light, who knows. edit:typo', '2005-12-02 14:47:07.000000', '2005-12-05 07:05:37.000000', 1),
