(1922405, 262613, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good story line, very dramatic.  Congratulations!  Good to see three of my favorite photographers on top with ribbons.  Of course, individually for you three, that''s not unusual!</td>', 'Good story line, very dramatic.  Congratulations!  Good to see three of my favorite photographers on top with ribbons.  Of course, individually for you three, that''s not unusual!', '2005-12-05 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
