(1922410, 262780, 22379, '<td valign="top">i spent way to much time waiting for glue to dry and ran out of time for taking a decent photo. I do not deserve the kind comments i recieved because the exicution was crappy at best. <br/>If i had spent a little less time procrastinating and started this a couple of hours earlier, it could have been a shoe in (boom boom) for a ribbon., Needless to say, i wont learn a thing and will continue to shoot myself in the foot by waiting until the last minute haha.</td>', 'i spent way to much time waiting for glue to dry and ran out of time for taking a decent photo. I do not deserve the kind comments i recieved because the exicution was crappy at best. If i had spent a little less time procrastinating and started this a couple of hours earlier, it could have been a shoe in (boom boom) for a ribbon., Needless to say, i wont learn a thing and will continue to shoot myself in the foot by waiting until the last minute haha.', '2005-12-05 00:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
