(1922498, 262577, 43437, '<td valign="top">For me the picture was too dark, didnt have a vacation-e paradise feel.  Maybe if you had a view from the chairs out to the water, the angle is a little overdone also, I dont know but it makes me feel like im falling.  If you could lighten everything up, maybe contrast everything it would make it stand out more.  The location is beautiful.</td>', 'For me the picture was too dark, didnt have a vacation-e paradise feel.  Maybe if you had a view from the chairs out to the water, the angle is a little overdone also, I dont know but it makes me feel like im falling.  If you could lighten everything up, maybe contrast everything it would make it stand out more.  The location is beautiful.', '2005-12-05 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 0),
