(1922509, 262780, 7706, '<td valign="top">I would recognise these shoes anywhere lol Although the spelling of "mum" gave it away.<br/> <br/>I would like to see a different version of this, cuz its not your best work. Its very grainy. Its a cool idea though :)<br/> <br/>Even if its last minute, learn from it. :)</td>', 'I would recognise these shoes anywhere lol Although the spelling of "mum" gave it away. I would like to see a different version of this, cuz its not your best work. Its very grainy. Its a cool idea though :) Even if its last minute, learn from it. :)', '2005-12-05 00:48:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1922514, 262577, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gloomy and foreboding, tilted horizon, didn''t use the full range of tones, very static composition, tenuous relationship to challenge topic for the voter: per your request, these are reasons you didn''t do very well... Keep on plugging away at it!</td>', 'Gloomy and foreboding, tilted horizon, didn''t use the full range of tones, very static composition, tenuous relationship to challenge topic for the voter: per your request, these are reasons you didn''t do very well... Keep on plugging away at it!', '2005-12-05 00:49:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1922517, 262212, 40019, '<td valign="top">Shannon, you just don''t know when to quit!  Congrats on a awesome shot, you got a 9 from me on this one.  I just wish my kids were as into helping their good ole'' Dad as your kids are with your photography.  Great picture!</td>', 'Shannon, you just don''t know when to quit!  Congrats on a awesome shot, you got a 9 from me on this one.  I just wish my kids were as into helping their good ole'' Dad as your kids are with your photography.  Great picture!', '2005-12-05 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1922531, 262577, 37893, '<td valign="top">The image in itself is underexposed in my opinion. Though the thought of a "vacation getaway" might seem to be an adult thing to do, it is however, short of what DPCers were looking for in this challenge. <br/> <br/>Compositionally, the image lacks punch. It''s just lawn chairs and nothing else. The horizon is tilted and there are quite a few distracting elements that would other wise probably garner a few extra points ie. the tree on the right side (you could have cloned this out) and that circle thing to the back of the image (my eye seems to draw me back there). <br/> <br/>I gave this image a 5 and never looked back. The title also seems to be a bit off as seen from the few comments you had received. It was quite hard to tie the title back into the image.<br/> <br/>Again, these are my own opinions and you should take it for what it is. It''s too bad that the image was underexposed. Maybe a bit of PP would have helped this image.<br/> <br/>Rikki</td>', 'The image in itself is underexposed in my opinion. Though the thought of a "vacation getaway" might seem to be an adult thing to do, it is however, short of what DPCers were looking for in this challenge.  Compositionally, the image lacks punch. It''s just lawn chairs and nothing else. The horizon is tilted and there are quite a few distracting elements that would other wise probably garner a few extra points ie. the tree on the right side (you could have cloned this out) and that circle thing to the back of the image (my eye seems to draw me back there).  I gave this image a 5 and never looked back. The title also seems to be a bit off as seen from the few comments you had received. It was quite hard to tie the title back into the image. Again, these are my own opinions and you should take it for what it is. It''s too bad that the image was underexposed. Maybe a bit of PP would have helped this image. Rikki', '2005-12-05 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
