(1922842, 262566, 48560, '<td valign="top">I got here from your thread. Personally if I could have voted, this would have gotten.. and 8. I''m sorry but I dont see the dead log (you mentioned) probably because the green mould covered it completely, and the mould LOOKED like they were growing on damp rocks instead of a dead log. I love the lush greens and the stood out mushroom though. And your good control and use of DOF really makes this piece stand out. Too bad most of the voters cant agree with me. Definately not a less than 5 photo, you got robbed!</td>', 'I got here from your thread. Personally if I could have voted, this would have gotten.. and 8. I''m sorry but I dont see the dead log (you mentioned) probably because the green mould covered it completely, and the mould LOOKED like they were growing on damp rocks instead of a dead log. I love the lush greens and the stood out mushroom though. And your good control and use of DOF really makes this piece stand out. Too bad most of the voters cant agree with me. Definately not a less than 5 photo, you got robbed!', '2005-12-05 03:53:27.000000', NULL, 0),
