(1922954, 262704, 28029, '<td valign="top">Congratulations- Loved this pic (9) and thought it should ribbon. It is especially gratifying that someone such as yourself who spends so much time supporting the sitr and the novices like my self wins the ribbon. Thank you for all of your comments and insights.<br/>                --JR</td>', 'Congratulations- Loved this pic (9) and thought it should ribbon. It is especially gratifying that someone such as yourself who spends so much time supporting the sitr and the novices like my self wins the ribbon. Thank you for all of your comments and insights.                --JR', '2005-12-05 06:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1922960, 262704, 20941, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Daniel! Your talent certainly reaches beyond the studio! This is such a lovely scene so well suited to the challenge and very inviting!</td>', 'Congratulations Daniel! Your talent certainly reaches beyond the studio! This is such a lovely scene so well suited to the challenge and very inviting!', '2005-12-05 06:16:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1922984, 262780, 47327, '<td valign="top">Very inventive composition, full of humour !<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Very inventive composition, full of humour !Well done.', '2005-12-05 06:35:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923024, 262704, 7531, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon, it''s a dreamy shot, one that I wish I could be in, especailly with the fire and that bottle of Brandy?</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon, it''s a dreamy shot, one that I wish I could be in, especailly with the fire and that bottle of Brandy?', '2005-12-05 06:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923026, 262613, 7531, '<td valign="top">Super, well done and congratulations</td>', 'Super, well done and congratulations', '2005-12-05 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923028, 262212, 7531, '<td valign="top">Very cute and so well balanced light wise.</td>', 'Very cute and so well balanced light wise.', '2005-12-05 07:00:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923036, 262704, 24951, '<td valign="top">This shot creates a sense of nostalgia. Think your use of tone a good idea. Congratulations on the ribbon and on keeping the house intact.LOL</td>', 'This shot creates a sense of nostalgia. Think your use of tone a good idea. Congratulations on the ribbon and on keeping the house intact.LOL', '2005-12-05 07:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923089, 262566, 34192, '<td valign="top">I rated this image high on technicals, low for meeting the challenge, and medium for appeal.  Final score - 6.  Why?  Technically its sound.  I like nature shots and macro shots so the appeal was there, but not over the top.  As for meeting the challenge, it doesn''t scream adulthood to me.  Lifecycles maybe but adulthood is a stretch.  I see beginning and end, but not middle.  Sorry!</td>', 'I rated this image high on technicals, low for meeting the challenge, and medium for appeal.  Final score - 6.  Why?  Technically its sound.  I like nature shots and macro shots so the appeal was there, but not over the top.  As for meeting the challenge, it doesn''t scream adulthood to me.  Lifecycles maybe but adulthood is a stretch.  I see beginning and end, but not middle.  Sorry!', '2005-12-05 07:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923093, 262314, 6349, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I really thought this was going to ribbon!  Congrats on top ten anyway!  :)</td>', 'Oh man, I really thought this was going to ribbon!  Congrats on top ten anyway!  :)', '2005-12-05 07:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923113, 262704, 2240, '<td valign="top">Well done Daniel! Congratulations on the ribbon</td>', 'Well done Daniel! Congratulations on the ribbon', '2005-12-05 07:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923139, 262539, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm, I think it''s a matter of composition and lighting that affected your overall score.  It was a great idea, I just think you may not have spent enough time thinking about the outcome as you looked through the viewfinder...sometimes you got to wait for the light to be right.</td>', 'hrmm, I think it''s a matter of composition and lighting that affected your overall score.  It was a great idea, I just think you may not have spent enough time thinking about the outcome as you looked through the viewfinder...sometimes you got to wait for the light to be right.', '2005-12-05 08:11:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923149, 262539, 37719, '<td valign="top">Compositionally the shot is very busy.  The grass that is in the foreground and blurred is very distracting.  The light behind the structure is too bright and blown out on the left.  With the blurry foreground grasses the rest of the shot looks out of focus as well.  There is no real center of focus or anything to get your attention.<br/> <br/>For the challenge - there is little, if anything, here that ties it to the challenge.  The things you pointed out in your post - peering over a wall, etc. I don''t get from this at all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-05 08:23:41.</i></td>', 'Compositionally the shot is very busy.  The grass that is in the foreground and blurred is very distracting.  The light behind the structure is too bright and blown out on the left.  With the blurry foreground grasses the rest of the shot looks out of focus as well.  There is no real center of focus or anything to get your attention. For the challenge - there is little, if anything, here that ties it to the challenge.  The things you pointed out in your post - peering over a wall, etc. I don''t get from this at all.', '2005-12-05 08:20:22.000000', '2005-12-05 08:23:41.000000', 0),
(1923169, 262212, 3306, '<td valign="top">A very creative idea for a difficult challenge. Congrats on another ribbon.</td>', 'A very creative idea for a difficult challenge. Congrats on another ribbon.', '2005-12-05 08:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923171, 262656, 14386, '<td valign="top">Wow...surprise.  I never thought this will be in the top 10. I owe it all to Maya,  her mom, and Sally for setting this up for me.<br/> <br/>She''s in my top ten circle.  The first time I had her, I won a yellow. Here''s the pic.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=156228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/318/thumb/156228.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/318/thumb/156228.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/318/thumb/156228.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Thanks Maya.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-06 08:40:29.</i></td>', 'Wow...surprise.  I never thought this will be in the top 10. I owe it all to Maya,  her mom, and Sally for setting this up for me. She''s in my top ten circle.  The first time I had her, I won a yellow. Here''s the pic.   Thanks Maya.', '2005-12-05 08:35:31.000000', '2005-12-06 08:40:29.000000', 0),
(1923172, 262212, 47327, '<td valign="top">Very happy you won the challenge with this very sensitive and humouristic shot !<br/>Congrats</td>', 'Very happy you won the challenge with this very sensitive and humouristic shot !Congrats', '2005-12-05 08:36:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923175, 262613, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have a talent for creating fascinating shots with common subjects. Your ability to create "mood" is unsurpassed. Great job. Congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'You have a talent for creating fascinating shots with common subjects. Your ability to create "mood" is unsurpassed. Great job. Congrats on the ribbon', '2005-12-05 08:36:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923177, 262704, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. You have shown another side to your talents. Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'Very well composed. You have shown another side to your talents. Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2005-12-05 08:38:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923179, 262539, 3724, '<td valign="top">A lovely rustic screened grid with a filter of light and atmosphere hanging like a golden shroud....<br/>beautiful.   fyi 6</td>', 'A lovely rustic screened grid with a filter of light and atmosphere hanging like a golden shroud....beautiful.   fyi 6', '2005-12-05 08:39:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923183, 262539, 10634, '<td valign="top">Well, I gave you a three. Seeing only one plant in there I hd no idea this was a greenhouse first off. I thought it was perhaps a screened in porch. The title added to my conclusion. The foreground is very distracting as are the blurry gold streaks reaching into the sky (most noticeabel on the left). Lastly, it just doesn''t have a strong feeling of adulthood.</td>', 'Well, I gave you a three. Seeing only one plant in there I hd no idea this was a greenhouse first off. I thought it was perhaps a screened in porch. The title added to my conclusion. The foreground is very distracting as are the blurry gold streaks reaching into the sky (most noticeabel on the left). Lastly, it just doesn''t have a strong feeling of adulthood.', '2005-12-05 08:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923212, 262566, 10634, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5 (mainly because of your out-of-the-box thinking... otherwise I probably would have scored it lower). I did get what you were going for somewhat. I''m not one who needs to be hit over the head with the idea as I usually get these "out-of-the-box" submissions. I just didn''t feel you pulled off the idea you were going for well. Had I not read your post I never would have know the object this was growing on was a tree as it is just not evident here (it really looks like dirt). I think composition needed a little improvement. Perhaps shaving off a little of the bottom (particularly the right) to make it feel less centered. I know you felt the additional wood took from the overall impact, but i would still like to have seen it. It might have helped people understand what you were going for better. Finally, there just wasn''t any "Wow" factor to this one for me. I give my highest marks to those I feel met the challenge and are still interesting enough for me to want on my wall. This just didn''t fit the bill for me.</td>', 'I gave you a 5 (mainly because of your out-of-the-box thinking... otherwise I probably would have scored it lower). I did get what you were going for somewhat. I''m not one who needs to be hit over the head with the idea as I usually get these "out-of-the-box" submissions. I just didn''t feel you pulled off the idea you were going for well. Had I not read your post I never would have know the object this was growing on was a tree as it is just not evident here (it really looks like dirt). I think composition needed a little improvement. Perhaps shaving off a little of the bottom (particularly the right) to make it feel less centered. I know you felt the additional wood took from the overall impact, but i would still like to have seen it. It might have helped people understand what you were going for better. Finally, there just wasn''t any "Wow" factor to this one for me. I give my highest marks to those I feel met the challenge and are still interesting enough for me to want on my wall. This just didn''t fit the bill for me.', '2005-12-05 08:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1923374, 262566, 3724, '<td valign="top">I have no problem with a ambivalent relationship to the challenge in this picture......  this is quite a good specimen view, it shows excellent scale to an ample natural environment.  fyi 5</td>', 'I have no problem with a ambivalent relationship to the challenge in this picture......  this is quite a good specimen view, it shows excellent scale to an ample natural environment.  fyi 5', '2005-12-05 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
