(1923505, 262212, 22872, '<td valign="top">I wondered if that was your little boy!!!  This was just too dang cool!!!  (and isn''t it the truth!)  My fiancee'' and I were just talking about how it''s hard to get *cough* quiet time without one of the kids knocking or saying "Mom or Troy"! :)<br/> <br/>**You Rock!** :)<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-05 10:54:50.</i></td>', 'I wondered if that was your little boy!!!  This was just too dang cool!!!  (and isn''t it the truth!)  My fiancee'' and I were just talking about how it''s hard to get *cough* quiet time without one of the kids knocking or saying "Mom or Troy"! :) **You Rock!** :) ', '2005-12-05 10:51:57.000000', '2005-12-05 10:54:50.000000', 0),
