(1924045, 262566, 22872, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photograph.  I gave it 6....but I have to tell you....I didn''t get it at all.  I read it....reread it...and still didn''t get it....but I really liked the photo. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really liked this photograph.  I gave it 6....but I have to tell you....I didn''t get it at all.  I read it....reread it...and still didn''t get it....but I really liked the photo. :) ', '2005-12-05 13:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
