(1925241, 262539, 15711, '<td valign="top">This just has kind of a snapshot feel to it.  There isn''t anything to really draw me in.  It seems a bit busy.  If you were wanting a nostalgic sense, maybe using a sepia filter would have helped to even out the entire image so to speak.  Keep it up though, the next one will be better!</td>', 'This just has kind of a snapshot feel to it.  There isn''t anything to really draw me in.  It seems a bit busy.  If you were wanting a nostalgic sense, maybe using a sepia filter would have helped to even out the entire image so to speak.  Keep it up though, the next one will be better!', '2005-12-05 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
