(1931082, 262613, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wow! You weren''t just talkin'' trash in the Adulthood scores thread. You really WERE up there. I''m always amazed at people like you and JJ who can make something beautiful out of a scene that I''d probably drive right past. Congrats on the red- this should have scored higher (.01 higher). ;-P<br/> <br/>Let me add to all the other people who said this would''ve been great for the Industrial challenge. You should have... um... oh. Nevermind.</td>', 'Wow! You weren''t just talkin'' trash in the Adulthood scores thread. You really WERE up there. I''m always amazed at people like you and JJ who can make something beautiful out of a scene that I''d probably drive right past. Congrats on the red- this should have scored higher (.01 higher). ;-P Let me add to all the other people who said this would''ve been great for the Industrial challenge. You should have... um... oh. Nevermind.', '2005-12-07 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
