(1951717, 262656, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good, the tight crop to the right doesn''t bother me, even with the cut off leg, that is not a problem. If it hadn''t been for the stool with the shoes it wouldn''t have worked. The stairs or whatever it is in the background left brings in the balance. But I don''t really like the irregularities in the background, especially immediately behind the girl''s head. Also the prominent dark part of the stool leg on the left of the girl''s calf muscle I would have taken out.</td>', 'Good, the tight crop to the right doesn''t bother me, even with the cut off leg, that is not a problem. If it hadn''t been for the stool with the shoes it wouldn''t have worked. The stairs or whatever it is in the background left brings in the balance. But I don''t really like the irregularities in the background, especially immediately behind the girl''s head. Also the prominent dark part of the stool leg on the left of the girl''s calf muscle I would have taken out.', '2005-12-14 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1953870, 261175, 23394, '<td valign="top">very interesting take on the challenge.  yeah, a bit out of the box for dpc, but still a killer image!  keep it up!!!</td>', 'very interesting take on the challenge.  yeah, a bit out of the box for dpc, but still a killer image!  keep it up!!!', '2005-12-15 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
